From 141fcb8790ad61886b5891e58afe500f95a59897 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:26:05 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] custom_rom_hide: Hide ROM packages on core UIDs from
 unprivileged apps

Only core UIDs, system/privileged apps, SystemUI and the default launcher
can keep full visibility.

Signed-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>

evox9: picked from Evolution-X/frameworks_base@b0a4ac0d11 (ComputerEngine hunks applied as-is;
AppsFilterBase.java taken from upstream cnb, which is ours + this commit).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
